        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/takewalker/{size}/5677_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-09-28T12:24:16.773Z",
        "cooked": "<p>Really just goes to show Deadline is a pushover no matter what he brings out. Focus your attacks on him, ignore the Catastrophes, make sure to get enough Links out to weather Magnetic Pole Shift and you’re golden.</p>",
