        "username": "doppelgangerung",
        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/doppelgangerung/{size}/1876_2.png",
        "created_at": "2021-09-28T15:21:02.905Z",
        "cooked": "<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/original/2X/3/3914b6b881a7718e42912fec62667a9b7f2374b7.jpeg\" data-download-href=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/3914b6b881a7718e42912fec62667a9b7f2374b7\" title=\"Screenshot_20210928-012402\"><img src=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3914b6b881a7718e42912fec62667a9b7f2374b7_2_219x500.jpeg\" alt=\"Screenshot_20210928-012402\" data-base62-sha1=\"88XASvMDXEmu3OrJYZb5E0x2WSX\" width=\"219\" height=\"500\" srcset=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3914b6b881a7718e42912fec62667a9b7f2374b7_2_219x500.jpeg, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3914b6b881a7718e42912fec62667a9b7f2374b7_2_328x750.jpeg 1.5x, https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3914b6b881a7718e42912fec62667a9b7f2374b7_2_438x1000.jpeg 2x\" data-small-upload=\"https://forums.greaterthangames.com/uploads/default/optimized/2X/3/3914b6b881a7718e42912fec62667a9b7f2374b7_2_10x10.png\"><div class=\"meta\">\n<svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">Screenshot_20210928-012402</span><span class=\"informations\">1080×2460 169 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use xlink:href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg>\n</div></a></div><br>\nDidn’t have much trouble at all, though starting without any Ongoing destruction, and being unable to play any until after Deadline flipped was not ideal. He flipped and did his unpleasant business, but Chrono Ranger and Visionary kept his catastrophes off the board after that so that he flipped back the next round, and by that time the team was ready to clobber him before he could do any more damage.</p>\n<p>Pretty straightforward slugfest - I had hoped to Twist Deadline’s Ether to reduce the damage he was doing with every destroyed catastrophe, but things fell out differently, and by the time I could play TtE, Writhe really needed it for a Concealed Assailant combo, and it all just happened so fast!</p>",
